  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Community Access and Urban Services Enhancement (CAUSE) Project Phase Two, Solomon Islands</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAUSE 2 will continue and expand the efforts of its successor program (CAUSE) to assist Solomon Islands with economic growth and recovery from COVID-19. Led by the World Bank and implemented by the Solomon Islands Government, it will deliver small-scale, community-based infrastructure, provide short-term employment and training opportunities for vulnerable groups (predominantly women and youths), and build the capacity of national and local authorities in infrastructure and urban services management.</narrative>
  </description>
